        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/5e41f2a4442af6a82e48798bd55c9488.avif?t=1785941268\" width=804 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/a0d4c8b451ee1d8a64ec9542bffef432.poster.avif?t=1785941268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/a0d4c8b451ee1d8a64ec9542bffef432.webm?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/a0d4c8b451ee1d8a64ec9542bffef432.mp4?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>What you do during the day pays off at night: gather resources, place buildings, merge structures, trade resources, choose your NPCs wisely, send them on expeditions, deploy soldiers, merge units, and position your troops strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Factory Buildings: Produce the main resource you need to build and upgrade your base. <br>Ammunition Buildings: Create ammo for soldiers, defenses, and special attacks. <br>Barracks Buildings: Train new soldiers every cycle. <br>Laboratory Buildings: Generate research points for permanent upgrades that carry over between runs. <br>House Buildings: Increase population limit, allowing you to grow your army. <br>Merge-Based Building System: Soldiers and buildings automatically merge when placed smartly on the grid.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4dd144280460fedbfe30cf7bff7826f3.avif?t=1785941268\" width=804 height=147 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2f7d1b502e1c0ed2850b8a84844691bf.poster.avif?t=1785941268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2f7d1b502e1c0ed2850b8a84844691bf.webm?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2f7d1b502e1c0ed2850b8a84844691bf.mp4?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When night falls, don’t give up if your strategy isn’t working. You still have tricks: call in airstrikes and collect boosters to power up the defense units you placed during the day.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/dfe6bb15a6aedb2371909469789af8e7.avif?t=1785941268\" width=804 height=104 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/7ae4b0910267d64dd4a6dba704335958.poster.avif?t=1785941268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/7ae4b0910267d64dd4a6dba704335958.webm?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/7ae4b0910267d64dd4a6dba704335958.mp4?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Lost a run? It’s time to come back stronger. Spend the research points you’ve earned, pick the permanent upgrades that match your strategy, and try again. Each run, you’ll get better than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Permanent Meta Progression: 13 research trees providing persistent upgrades. <br>13 Research Trees: Choose upgrade paths trough 150+ meta upgrades that complement your playstyle. <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/051136a7d27bd695eb7582a318ca0164.avif?t=1785941268\" width=800 height=146 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4dcd95e4f3f05e43017abb7e7be22215.poster.avif?t=1785941268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4dcd95e4f3f05e43017abb7e7be22215.webm?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4dcd95e4f3f05e43017abb7e7be22215.mp4?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Constant combat, constant adrenaline! As you defend your city, the action never slows down for a second. Build your strategy and stay in control in the heart of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/03a5e50865654320385a0a25b3623388.avif?t=1785941268\" width=804 height=124 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4b2f352ee85ab43c10ce8b0233aff8a6.poster.avif?t=1785941268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4b2f352ee85ab43c10ce8b0233aff8a6.webm?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4b2f352ee85ab43c10ce8b0233aff8a6.mp4?t=1785941268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who’s on top? Check the leaderboard… our cat is already watching  👀🐱</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
